Package: eventFluxR
Type: Package
Title: Detect, Model and Evaluate Hot-Moment Flux Events
Version: 0.1.0
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Authors@R: person("Junbin", "Zhao", email = "junbin.zhao@nibio.no", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reusable functions for identifying hot-moment events in
    biogeochemical flux time series using a robust MAD-based rule
    (with threshold sensitivity checks, event grouping and duration
    calculation), computing decay-weighted fertilization indices,
    fitting "class-swap" XGBoost models that separately model
    background and hot-moment fluxes after classification, and
    evaluating both classification (detection rate, false alarm rate,
    PR-AUC) and regression (RMSE, MAE, ME by flux class, upper-tail
    bias) performance.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    stats,
    utils,
    xgboost
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
